  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): field-name vs. field-contents mismatch on sketch_precomputed.centrality_scores; cli.py:8094 explicitly skips source files (this is the Additional Files section's pre-compute, sketch.py:6473 is the sole correct consumer). Same untyped-dict pattern as INV-modor-vokot (readme_description heuristic concat bug) and INV-padoz-juvum (vocabulary 12-entry no-lemma); sketch_precomputed has no schema. Suggested rename: additional_file_centrality_scores, with a separate field reserved for whole-graph centrality if/when needed. Adjacent perf items in the linked bucket: WI-ribag-bilav (warm-cache sketch slow, centrality not cached at analysis level) and WI-zipoj-ludaj (>1M LOC warm sketch 14-22 min) — both touch the centrality cache mechanism but are independent of the naming/scope issue here."  # 12a9
