  nonce: 6f26  # 6f26
  message: "Re-verified reproducing 2026-06-24 (self-analysis of hypergumbo_core: 154 centrality_scores entries, 0 are .py; 153 .yaml + 1 .md). KEY FIX-SHAPE FINDING (prevents the WRONG fix): the correct fix is a RENAME, NOT repopulating with whole-graph centrality. Producer cli.py:8288-8304 computes compute_symbol_mention_centrality_batch over candidate_files = the Additional-Files candidate set (non-source docs/configs; source excluded BY DESIGN). Consumers sketch.py:6458-6462 and 6608-6614 feed those scores into the Additional-Files RANKING (sketch.py:4325-4335 ranks candidate_files). So repopulating the field with source-graph centrality would BREAK the Additional Files ranking -- the field is correctly additional-file-scoped, only mis-named. PLAN SEQUENCING: per correctness_strategy_06102026.md:194 the centrality respec belongs to sketch-cache:F1 (WAVE 4) -- quote \"centrality respec documents BOTH zero paths\" -- and the sketch additional-files surface MUST co-release with file-anchor:F1 (strategy:112; centrality keys come from the file-anchor anchor cohort). So INV-napap is NOT a standalone-now rename; it lands inside the Wave-4 typed SketchPrecomputed contract, co-released with file-anchor:F1. Suggested name when done: additional_file_centrality_scores. Source: lab notebook notebookjournal_06242026_0440.md + Option-B spirit audit."  # 6f26
