  message: "Resolved via RENAME (the human-approved fix shape, NOT repopulation), commit 037a3730de. sketch_precomputed.centrality_scores -> additional_file_centrality_scores at every producer (cli.py) and consumer (sketch.py) site; the whole sketch_precomputed block marked x-internal in docs/schema.json with a description stating the scope ('Non-source-file-path -> symbol-mention centrality score... config/doc files only, NOT whole-graph symbol centrality'). The field correctly excludes source files BY DESIGN (it ranks the sketch's Additional-Files section); the defect per root_cause was the misleading NAME implying whole-graph centrality, which the rename fixes. Whole-graph centrality already exists separately (hypergumbo symbols / ranking.compute_centrality). Live repro (rust-analyzer pkg): additional_file_centrality_scores present, legacy 'centrality_scores' key absent. This is INV-jifus's centrality face."  # c2eb
